        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "queue",
      "say": "Now everyone wants one, and Gary builds them alone.",
      "callouts": []
    },
    {
      "id": "line",
      "say": "So you roll each car past a row of stations, one job each. This is called an assembly line. Ford's line cut a car from 12 hours to 93 minutes. Your Roomba pulls the rope. Promoted.",
