    },
    {
      "id": "jit",
      "say": "A car has 30,000 parts, and they all arrive at once. Gary is buried in steering wheels. So each part arrives minutes before it's needed. This is called just-in-time. Toyota invented it. The Roomba took credit. Manager.",
